# controllers/
# This folder will contain all controller files.
# Controllers handle the business logic for each feature.
# 
# Planned controllers (Phase 2+):
#   authController.js       - Register, login, logout, token refresh
#   userController.js       - User CRUD, profile management
#   teamController.js       - Team member CRUD
#   galleryController.js    - Gallery CRUD + Cloudinary upload
#   achievementController.js- Achievement CRUD
#   contactController.js    - Contact form submission handling
#   homeController.js       - Home page CMS content
#   eventController.js      - Events CRUD
#   sponsorController.js    - Sponsor application handling
#   joinController.js       - Join team application handling
#   adminController.js      - Admin dashboard + analytics
